					"$\\sin 45^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ et $\\sin 60^\\circ=\\dfrac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ : $AC=\\dfrac{{{eval:k}}\\sqrt{2}\\times\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}}{\\frac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}}$.",
					"Les $\\dfrac{\\sqrt{2}}{2}$ se simplifient : $AC=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:k}}\\sqrt{3}}$ cm."
				]
