		{
			"statement": "Dans un triangle $ABC$, on admet la loi des sinus :\n\n$$\\dfrac{BC}{\\sin\\widehat{A}}=\\dfrac{AC}{\\sin\\widehat{B}}=\\dfrac{AB}{\\sin\\widehat{C}}$$\n\nDans le triangle $ABC$, $\\widehat{A}=30^\\circ$, $BC={{eval:a}}$ cm et $AC={{eval:b}}$ cm. Calcule $\\sin\\widehat{B}$, en valeur exacte.\n\n$\\sin\\widehat{B}=?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "3..9"
				},
