					"expectedAnswer": "{{eval:b/(2*a)}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"La loi des sinus donne $\\dfrac{AC}{\\sin\\widehat{B}}=\\dfrac{BC}{\\sin\\widehat{A}}$, donc $\\sin\\widehat{B}=\\dfrac{AC\\times\\sin\\widehat{A}}{BC}$.",
					"$\\sin 30^\\circ=\\dfrac{1}{2}$ : $\\sin\\widehat{B}=\\dfrac{{{eval:b}}\\times\\frac{1}{2}}{{{eval:a}}}$.",
					"Donc $\\sin\\widehat{B}=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{eval:b/(2*a)}}}$."
